[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16140.389, "timestamp": "04:29:00", "text": "椰子。那就像，你知道，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16143.91, "timestamp": "04:29:03", "text": "等等，那是人吗？等等，什么？等待，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16146.309, "timestamp": "04:29:06", "text": "不，那不是人。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16149.99, "timestamp": "04:29:09", "text": "就像里面有一个黑球或黑点一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16152.95, "timestamp": "04:29:12", "text": "座位。就像有三个点一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16156.55, "timestamp": "04:29:16", "text": "或者别的什么。等等，那是人吗？不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16158.149, "timestamp": "04:29:18", "text": "不，绝对不可能。哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16161.03, "timestamp": "04:29:21", "text": "我觉得那就像……该怎么称呼呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16164.55, "timestamp": "04:29:24", "text": "它？就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16168.07, "timestamp": "04:29:28", "text": "呃，我觉得那是渔网。是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16170.469, "timestamp": "04:29:30", "text": "我觉得那是张渔网。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16172.55, "timestamp": "04:29:32", "text": "我觉得那是个……呃……那个东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16175.269, "timestamp": "04:29:35", "text": "就在海里人们放置的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16179.229, "timestamp": "04:29:39", "text": "就像……该怎么称呼它呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16181.79, "timestamp": "04:29:41", "text": "类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16185.75, "timestamp": "04:29:45", "text": "呃，是不是就像那里？我忘了它是什么了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16186.67, "timestamp": "04:29:46", "text": "称为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16190.07, "timestamp": "04:29:50", "text": "再说一遍，这都是为了船只之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16193.51, "timestamp": "04:29:53", "text": "我知道方向，也喜欢我看到的东西，比如一艘船。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16196.269, "timestamp": "04:29:56", "text": "那是货物吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16199.309, "timestamp": "04:29:59", "text": "那艘船真的很远"}]